%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
/s { length r } def
/e { stopped b } def
currentfile 4 string readstring
abcdefgh
b s
/t 3 string def currentfile t readstring
xyz
pop pop t s
{ currentfile 0 string readstring } e
currentfile 4 string readhexstring
4142 4344 4546
b s
currentfile 2 string readhexstring
zz41 zz42
b s
{ currentfile 0 string readhexstring } e
(x) (y) writestring 9 r
